<title>SWEDEN: Stora says prices, crown hit profits.</title>
<headline>Stora says prices, crown hit profits.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company Stora said on Wednesday that lower prices and lower delivery volumes negatively affected 1996 profits by 4.7 billion crowns.</p>
<p>Stora said a stronger crown also hit profits by 750 million crowns.</p>
</text>
